---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Squiggle from '../components/Squiggle.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy — Illustrate Words"
  description="Read about Illustrate Words's offline-first privacy model. We do not store, track, or share your data, prompts, or search logs."
>
  <!-- Hero banner -->
  <section class="bg-cream pt-16 pb-12 md:py-20 border-b border-cream-darker/30 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Floating background sparkles -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-40">
      <div class="absolute top-12 left-10 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent-lavender animate-float"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-accent-pink animate-float delay-300"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container-page relative text-center max-w-3xl">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <span class="pill-cream">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accent-lime animate-pulse"></span>
          Privacy First
        </span>
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="headline-display">
        Privacy <em>Policy</em>
      </h1>
      
      <p class="mt-6 body-lg text-ink-secondary">
        We believe that your thoughts and visual brainstorming documents belong solely to you. Illustrate Words is built as an offline-first utility.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-tertiary">
        Last updated: June 28, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center">
        <Squiggle color="#8ED44A" width="100" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class="section bg-cream-lighter py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <div class="prose prose-cream max-w-none text-ink-secondary space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
        
        <!-- Offline first callout card -->
        <div class="bg-accent-lavender/10 border-1.5 border-accent-lavender rounded-card p-6 md:p-8 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink-primary flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-accent-lavender text-xl">✦</span> The Core Philosophy
          </h2>
          <p class="body-base">
            Illustrate Words does not use server databases, user accounts, or tracking APIs. All customizations, text entries, and prompt outputs are processed and stored locally inside your browser's memory using standard client-side technologies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            1. Information Collection
          </h2>
          <p>
            Because Illustrate Words operates as a static page running in your client browser, **we do not collect, store, or transmit any personal data**.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
              <strong>Text Inputs:</strong> Any description, data, or structural content you paste in the prompt generator never leaves your device. The prompt formulas are computed purely in local JavaScript.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Browser Storage:</strong> We use standard browser local storage (`localStorage`) to remember your configurations (e.g., your selected category, palette preferences, or connector styles) so you don't have to re-enter them on reload. This data remains on your machine.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>No Account Portal:</strong> We do not require registration, passwords, OAuth sign-ins, or email listings to use the application.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            2. Cookies and Tracking
          </h2>
          <p>
            We do not use tracking cookies, tracking pixels, or third-party web analytics tools (like Google Analytics or Hotjar). 
          </p>
          <p>
            Our host provider (Cloudflare Pages) may gather basic, anonymous server-level logs (such as request rates, user-agents, and server response codes) to prevent denial-of-service attacks and ensure global speed. These logs contain no personal information.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            3. Third-Party Services
          </h2>
          <p>
            Illustrate Words is a **prompt constructor**. It produces rich, formatted text descriptions which you copy and submit to other artificial intelligence systems (such as OpenAI's ChatGPT, Google Gemini, Anthropic's Claude, or Midjourney).
          </p>
          <p class="border-l-4 border-accent-lime pl-4 italic text-ink-tertiary">
            IMPORTANT: When you paste these generated prompts into external AI tools, your text inputs are subject to those third-party providers' own privacy policies and terms of service. We encourage you to review their terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            4. Security and Data Privacy
          </h2>
          <p>
            By designing the system without any central database, we have minimized the security risk for our users. There is no central database to leak, hack, or compromise. 
          </p>
          <p>
            To clear all your local configuration settings, simply clear your browser's site data / cache for this site.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            5. Changes to This Policy
          </h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time as we introduce new prompt variables or integrations. Any modifications will be posted directly on this page with an updated timestamp.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-ink-primary">
            6. Contact
          </h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions or feedback regarding our privacy approach, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="underline hover:text-accent-lavender">Contact Page</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
